    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University (AKU) proudly announces that Dr Zulfiqar A. Bhutta, Founding Director of the Institute for Global Health and Development (IGHD), and Dr Jai K. Das, Assistant Director of IGHD and Associate Professor of Paediatrics and Child Health, have been recognized in the Highly Cited Researchers 2024 list by Clarivate - a leading global information services provider that identifies and celebrates influential researchers through a rigorous evaluation of scholarly impact.",
